 clang-tools-extra/clangd/ModulesBuilder.cpp   | 168 ++++++++++++++++--
 clang-tools-extra/clangd/ModulesBuilder.h     |  15 ++
 .../test/Inputs/modules-cache-driver.py       | 104 +++++++++++
 .../clangd/test/modules-validation-cache.test |  13 ++
